abstract: >-
  REC turns quizzes into a live TV game show. The sooner students answer, the more each
  correct answer is worth; they get a ticket with a verification code, and the teacher gets
  rankings, bonuses and an analysis of what they learnt. It runs entirely in the browser,
  with no servers or student accounts, and is published as a static site such as GitHub Pages.
